SUMMARY:American Assholes: Escape to Edinburgh
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:A Queer\, African and Indigenous American trio (HBO\, Don't Tel
 l\, Amazon Prime\, New York Times – Critic's Pick\, Time Out)\, unite for
  a cross-cultural comedy hour dissecting identity\, politics\, and why Amer
 icans might\, in fact\, be the worst. Smart\, sharp\, and occasionally unhi
 nged\, these comics deliver a Venn diagram of perspectives\, overlapping in
  their desperate pursuit of something better: possibly love\, definitely a 
 visa. Featuring modern social satire and a marriage raffle of dubious legal
 ity. Free. Irreverent. Potentially inadmissible in court.\nMore info: https
 ://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/american-assholes-escape-to-edinburgh
 /
